      "text": "arXiv:q-alg/9712055v2 12 Jan 1998 — We consider functions on the lattice generated by the integer powers of q2 for 0 < q < 1 and construct the q-analog of Fourier transform based on the Jackson\n\n**arXiv:q-alg/9712055v2 12 Jan 1998**\n\n*ITEP, 117259, Moscow*\n\n18 pp, 5 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** We consider functions on the lattice generated by the integer powers of q2 for 0 < q < 1 and construct the q-analog of Fourier transform based on the Jackson integral in the space of distributions on the lattice.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Preliminary relations; 5 The $q^2$-Fourier transform; 6 The $q^2$-Fourier transform of $q^2$-distrib",
